  "summary": "Malicious code in vl-ui-accordion (npm)",
  "details": "Vl-ui-accordion@1.0.0 is an inert placeholder package published under the name of the real vl-ui-* (Flemish government) UI component library family. The tarball contains only a package.json with empty install hooks and an index.js holding a single comment; there is no repository, no code, and no dependencies. It is a name-squat placeholder occupying the namespace of a legitimate component library, with no functional implementation shipped.",
